{"id":"305651556","kind":"article","title":"间隔重复 (spaced repetition)","author":"Piotr Wozniak","original_authors":["Piotr Wozniak"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Spaced_repetition"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2020-11-22","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":38,"comment_count":0,"minutes":2,"chars":1169,"keywords":["间隔重复","SuperMemo","遗忘曲线","最优间隔","记忆模型"],"summary":"文章定义经计算的间隔重复：依据记忆模型优化各知识点的复习间隔，并简述 SuperMemo 的发展史及遗忘曲线、记忆双组分模型等实现。作者区分了间隔逐渐增加但未显式计算的复习安排与 SuperMemo 式优化算法。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/305651556","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"O-l7E3AE\"><b>间隔重复</b>是一种基于计算<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Optimum_interval\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">最佳间隔</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>的学习方法，该间隔将<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Item\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">各个知识</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Review\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">复习</a>分开，以达到理想的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Retention\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">保留</a>水平。<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/History_of_spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo 开创了优化方法在间隔重复中的应用</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>。在过去的 20 年里，间隔重复已经发展为<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Incremental_reading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">渐进阅读</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"KBW_M_SO\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://www.super-memo.com/supermemo18.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo 18 for Windows</a> 采用<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Forgetting_curve\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">遗忘曲线</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>和<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Two_component_model_of_memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">记忆双组分模型</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup>，做出<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Optimum_interval\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">最佳间隔</a>的预测。</p><p data-pid=\"mA9dSuoz\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo_for_DOS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo 1.0 for DOS</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup> 是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Algorithm_SM-2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复的第一个实现</a>（1987年）。2017 年 12 月 13 日，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo</a> 迎来了它的 30 岁生日。</p><p data-pid=\"VjUb88Ly\">该方法最早在 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Piotr_Wozniak\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Piotr Wozniak</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-9\"><a href=\"#ref-9\">[9]</a></sup> 的硕士论文中描述：1990 年的《<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Optimization_of_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习的优化</a>》，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/ANE1994\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1994 年的一个同行评议期刊</a>上也有描述。</p><p data-pid=\"eBAFpUE4\">用于指代间隔重复，与 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo</a> 的使用周期大致相同的其他术语：<i>SuperMemo method</i> (1989-1995), <i>optimum intervalization</i> (1990-1992), <i>scheduling repetitions</i> (1992-1995), <i>repetition spacing</i> or <i>spacing of repetitions</i> (1992-1999, literature), <i>graduated intervals</i> (Pimsleur), <i>spaced rehearsal</i> or <i>expanding rehearsal</i> (literature, e.g. Landauer &amp; Bjork), <i>spaced, expanded</i>, or <i>expanding retrieval</i> (literature), <i>spaced practice</i>, <i>expanded practice</i> or <i>distributed practice</i> (literature, e.g. Baddley), <i>optimum schedule</i> (literature, e.g. Pavlik), <i>spaced learning</i> or <i>spaced education</i>，等等。<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Who_invented_the_name:_spaced_repetition?\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1999 年 SuperMemo 采用</a>了间隔重复（<i>spaced repetition</i>）这一术语。更多内容请参见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Alternative_terms_for_spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复的替代术语</a></p><p data-pid=\"1c7AqQ-h\">由于在 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Birth_of_SuperMemo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo 诞生</a>之前，<b>间隔重复</b>这个术语被松散地使用，直到 1999 年才采用了现在的含义，因此，我们偶尔会使用经过<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Computational_spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">计算的间隔重复</a>这个术语来区分 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Optimization_of_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo method</a>和复习时间表（review schedule），在复习时间表中，间隔增加但没有明确计算或优化。</p><p data-pid=\"k1jAf10h\">另请参见：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"QlWHOY4w\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/General_principles_of_spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">什么是间隔重复？</a>(1990)</li><li data-pid=\"tEMFL8U8\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/History_of_spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复的历史</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup> (2018) </li><li data-pid=\"-P8yqrNe\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://www.super-memory.com/english/ol/background.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">研究背景</a> (1995)</li></ul><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 最优间隔 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"584041631\" href=\"#/post/584041631\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 条目 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"571700330\" href=\"#/post/571700330\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 间隔重复的历史 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"92640205\" href=\"#/post/92640205\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 增量阅读 <a href=\"https://www.yuque.com/supermemo/wiki/incremental_reading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.yuque.com/supermemo/wiki/incremental_reading</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 遗忘曲线 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"274352214\" href=\"#/post/274352214\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 记忆的两个组成成分 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"179076885\" href=\"#/post/179076885\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> 记忆的双组分模型 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"579476637\" href=\"#/post/579476637\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-8\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-8\">↩</a> SuperMemo 1.0: 日志 (1987) <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"97887756\" href=\"#/post/97887756\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-9\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-9\">↩</a> 彼得 · 沃兹尼亚克 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"303204832\" href=\"#/post/303204832\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"304800091","title":"记忆复杂性","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":19,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"307602868","title":"水蛭（Leech）[Anki, SuperMemo]","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"92640205","title":"01 前言","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":27,"minutes":4,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"97887756","title":"04 1987 SuperMemo 1.0: 日志","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":33,"minutes":14,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"303204832","title":"彼得 · 沃兹尼亚克","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":70,"minutes":9,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"279166945","title":"间隔效应","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":21,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「间隔重复」· Andy Matuschak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2202895186","title":"为什么我的成绩那么好，最终还是成了一个没用的人？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":3390,"minutes":35,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 3390 赞同","evidence":"回答中的原生引用/链接以“间隔重复 (spaced repetition)”明确指向目标译文标题或可唯一指向的关键词。"},{"id":"2690587187","title":"应试教育给中国带来了什么？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":1644,"minutes":66,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 1644 赞同","evidence":"该标题/关键词及链接随主译文《学校让人沾染上的 100+ 恶习》的摘录带入；只确认标题/关键词提及，没有逐对独立重述此目标译文的观点。"},{"id":"3095512261","title":"研究发现早晨课越多成绩越差，涉及到哪些医学知识？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":1486,"minutes":14,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 1486 赞同","evidence":"回答正文中的原生链接锚点“间隔重复 (spaced repetition)”明确指向该译文；该证据支持标题/关键词提及。"},{"id":"2024783376297596199","title":"如何看待“学生和家长仅仅希望高中不要凌晨五点半就到校，多睡一个小时，就被指责为想搞快乐教育”这句话？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":804,"minutes":82,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 804 赞同","evidence":"逐对核验：回答用该译文的直接脚注锚点指向文章标题或对应的特定术语。"},{"id":"3333217724","title":"学习是一件反人类的事情吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":546,"minutes":90,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 546 赞同","evidence":"正文中有明确指向该译文的知乎内链/链接卡，按直接提及记为1级。"}]}